      420.04,
      553.21
    ],
    "reading_order": 19,
    "text": "We can similarly make the table for the number of students with scores, more\nthan or equal to 0, more than or equal to 10, more than or equal to 20, and so on. From\nTable 13.12, we observe that all 53 students have scored marks more than or equal to",
    "latex": null,
